      "username": "Dipayan1",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/dipayan1/{size}/69459_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-04-03T02:40:22.083Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was unable to attempt the Week 6 and Week 7 Graded Review Assignments (GrPAs) within the stipulated deadline. This was due to my End Semester Examinations at my physical college, which were scheduled during the same period. Managing the concurrent academic commitments of two degree programmes simultaneously proved challenging, and I sincerely regret the oversight.</p>\n<p>I humbly request you to kindly consider granting an extension or an alternate submission window for the same. I am really sorry but at the same time hopeless.</p>\n<p>I assure you that this will not recur, and I remain committed to completing all coursework diligently.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your understanding and support.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
